    "Coordinate any therapeutic use with your provider." : {
      "comment" : "MANDATED SAFETY WARNING (CLAUDE.md). Not a therapy claim — a boundary. Translate faithfully; do not soften and do not imply Echoel is a treatment.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Etwaige therapeutische Anwendung mit deiner behandelnden Fachperson abstimmen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Coordinate any therapeutic use with your provider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For self-observation, not medical diagnosis." : {
      "comment" : "MANDATED SAFETY WARNING (CLAUDE.md). The sentence that keeps Echoel out of medical-device territory — its meaning must survive translation exactly.",
